3,Luri Folk Music - Melodigging,https://www.melodigging.com/genre/luri-folk-music,"Luri folk music is the traditional music of the Lur (Luri/Lak/Bakhtiari) peoples of Iran’s Zagros Mountains. It is a living, orally transmitted art that intertwines pastoral life, epic storytelling, and communal dance.","Luri, Northern",Indo-European
